items.Aetherhaven_Path_Tool.name=Path designer shovel
items.Aetherhaven_Path_Tool.description=Designs spline paths (<color is="#5AB5B5">aetherhaven.path.tool</color>). Secondary: add nodes. Primary: select; in move mode, click ground to move. Q: mode cycle. 2nd ability: path width 1-8. 3rd ability: path style (inner blocks; PathToolStyles in config). F: nudge yaw in rotate, or place in place mode (2+ nodes). Revert: aetherhaven path revert. Config: PathToolStyles, raycast, and replace lists.

items.Aetherhaven_Patrol_Wand.name=Patrol wand
items.Aetherhaven_Patrol_Wand.description=Sets guard patrol routes for your town (<color is="#5AB5B5">aetherhaven.patrol.wand</color>). Craft at the town planning desk. See the on screen legend while holding it.

aetherhaven.patrolWand.legendPageTitle=Patrol wand
aetherhaven.patrolWand.legendBlurb=Place patrol points, save a route, then assign a guard. Blue sparkles show routes only while you hold this wand.
aetherhaven.patrolWand.legendHotkeyAdd=Build mode: right click the ground to add a point. Right click a point to remove it.
aetherhaven.patrolWand.legendHotkeySelect=Left click a point on a saved route to select and edit that route.
aetherhaven.patrolWand.legendHotkeyUse=Build mode: F opens a name prompt and saves the route (needs at least two points). Assign mode: F opens a guard list for the selected route.
aetherhaven.patrolWand.legendHotkeyAbility=Q switches build and assign mode. E starts a new route in build mode, or removes the guard from the selected route in assign mode. R toggles closed loop in build mode.
aetherhaven.patrolWand.legendVisuals=Selected routes glow green. Other routes stay blue. Guards with more than one route take turns walking each loop.
